       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. FACTORIAL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 NUM PIC 9(2).
       01 I PIC 9(2).
       01 FACT PIC 9(10) VALUE 1.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ACCEPT NUM.

           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > NUM
               MULTIPLY I BY FACT
           END-PERFORM.

           DISPLAY "FACTORIAL: " FACT.

           STOP RUN.
